<Layout title="Website privacy" description="How the NRTH website handles inquiry drafts, browser preferences, and basic website access.">
  <article class="legal-content"><span class="eyebrow">Website information / October 8, 2026</span><h1>Privacy.</h1><p>This page describes the NRTH public website. Individual NRTH products and services may have separate privacy information appropriate to their actual operation.</p><h2>Your inquiries</h2><p>Preparing an inquiry keeps the draft in your browser. Choosing “Send inquiry” sends your name, email address, optional organization, selected topic, and message to the website’s submission endpoint. When delivery is configured, Resend processes the message for delivery to the relevant NRTH inbox. We use this information to respond to the conversation you initiate. An accepted submission confirms the email service accepted it; it does not confirm that a person has read it.</p><p>If website delivery is unavailable, the site tells you and preserves your draft. You can copy it, download it, or open it in your email app. Sending through an email app is a separate action controlled by you. Inquiry messages may remain in the recipient’s mailbox as part of the correspondence; contact NRTH to request access or deletion.</p><h2>Sample demonstrations</h2><p>The venture concepts use sample data. Their controls and downloads work locally in your browser and do not create shipments, health records, commercial orders, or event bookings.</p><h2>Your preferences</h2><p>The website stores your motion preference in local storage and respects your device’s reduced-motion setting. Editorial draft previews use a private, time-limited session cookie after an editor signs in.</p><h2>Website access and measurement</h2><p>Vercel hosts the website and processes technical request information to serve it. Fonts and artwork are served with the site. If website measurement is enabled for a deployment, Vercel Web Analytics records page visits and limited interaction events such as venture discovery or concept completion. Inquiry text, names, email addresses, and organizations are not included in those events. Advertising trackers are not included.</p><h2>Sensitive information</h2><p>Please do not include medical records, payment details, passwords, or other sensitive information in a general website inquiry.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Use the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> for a question about this website or the handling of your inquiry.</p></article>
</Layout>
